MATRIX: FizzBuzz, rewritten for the garage.
MATRIX: 3 -> COBRA, 5 -> TATE, 15 -> COBRATATE.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE label WITH n
  IF n MODULO 15 IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
    CASH OUT "COBRATATE"
  PERIOD
  IF n MODULO 3 IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
    CASH OUT "COBRA"
  PERIOD
  IF n MODULO 5 IS THE SAME AS 0 THEN
    CASH OUT "TATE"
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT n
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI n EQUALS 1
GRIND WHILE n IS LESS THAN 21
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL label WITH n
  BUGATTI n EQUALS n PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

BACK TO THE MATRIX
